{
  "$comment": "Quality rubric of the guide (gate G7, depth). Derived on 27.11.2026 from the structure and level of detail of two reference build guides (a Path of Exile 1 league starter guide and a Path of Exile 2 minion guide): an introduction in several paragraphs, strengths and weaknesses, a skill section with progression and rotation for clearing and bossing, a passive tree section that explains its choices, gear per slot with priorities and alternatives, crafting, endgame advice, build variants, a question section and a short summary. No text of those guides is used. Thresholds are quality bars set by the developers, not game facts; the product owner can change them. `rules` are measured by the app on the finished guide (count of entries or words at a JSON pointer, * is every element); `questions` are judged by Claude in one task per section. Each criterion names the task that is sent back.",
